source: crates/test-framework/src/snapshot/mod.rs
description: "Query: tpch_q4"
---
+---------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
+---------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |  Sort: orders.o_orderpriority ASC NULLS LAST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |   Projection: orders.o_orderpriority, count(Int64(1)) AS order_count                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |     Aggregate: groupBy=[[orders.o_orderpriority]], aggr=[[count(Int64(1))]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |       Filter: EXISTS (<subquery>)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |         Subquery:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |           Projection: lineitem.l_orderkey, lineitem.l_partkey, lineitem.l_suppkey, lineitem.l_linenumber, lineitem.l_quantity, lineitem.l_extendedprice, lineitem.l_discount, lineitem.l_tax, lineitem.l_returnflag, lineitem.l_linestatus, lineitem.l_shipdate, lineitem.l_commitdate, lineitem.l_receiptdate, lineitem.l_shipinstruct, lineitem.l_shipmode, lineitem.l_comment                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |             Filter: lineitem.l_orderkey = outer_ref(orders.o_orderkey)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |               TableScan: lineitem, full_filters=[lineitem.l_commitdate < lineitem.l_receiptdate]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |         TableScan: orders projection=[o_orderkey, o_orderpriority], full_filters=[orders.o_orderdate >= Utf8("1993-07-01"), orders.o_orderdate < CAST(Utf8("1993-07-01") AS Date32) + IntervalMonthDayNano("IntervalMonthDayNano { months: 3, days: 0, nanoseconds: 0 }")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
| physical_plan | SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |   CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |     BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |       VirtualExecutionPlan name=adbc compute_context=2ccce95fe2d4be687104db4fa81b90e6f680f2d2a8a2b7739b83e7164907678e base_sql=SELECT `orders`.`o_orderpriority`, count(1) AS `order_count` FROM `orders` WHERE EXISTS (SELECT `lineitem`.`l_orderkey`, `lineitem`.`l_partkey`, `lineitem`.`l_suppkey`, `lineitem`.`l_linenumber`, `lineitem`.`l_quantity`, `lineitem`.`l_extendedprice`, `lineitem`.`l_discount`, `lineitem`.`l_tax`, `lineitem`.`l_returnflag`, `lineitem`.`l_linestatus`, `lineitem`.`l_shipdate`, `lineitem`.`l_commitdate`, `lineitem`.`l_receiptdate`, `lineitem`.`l_shipinstruct`, `lineitem`.`l_shipmode`, `lineitem`.`l_comment` FROM `lineitem` WHERE (`lineitem`.`l_orderkey` = `orders`.`o_orderkey`) AND (`lineitem`.`l_commitdate` < `lineitem`.`l_receiptdate`)) AND ((`orders`.`o_orderdate` >= CAST(TIMESTAMP(REGEXP_REPLACE('1993-07-01', R'(\.\d{6})\d+', R'\1')) AS DATE)) AND (`orders`.`o_orderdate` < (CAST(TIMESTAMP(REGEXP_REPLACE('1993-07-01', R'(\.\d{6})\d+', R'\1')) AS DATE) + INTERVAL '3' MONTH))) GROUP BY `orders`.`o_orderpriority` ORDER BY `orders`.`o_orderpriority` ASC NULLS LAST |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
+---------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
